# A generic DirectInput pad SDL has no gamepad mapping for: 4 axes, 12 buttons, a hat
name dinput
device_name USB Gamepad
vendor 0x0079
product 0x0011
layout joystick
joytype unknown
family other
axes 4
buttons 12
hats 1
include joystick-standard.inc
control button10 jbutton 10
control button11 jbutton 11
control axis2+ jaxis 2 32767 0
control axis3+ jaxis 3 32767 0
